\\\"[\\\", StyleBox[\\\"spectrum\\\", \\\"TI\\\"], \\\"]\\\"}], \
\\\"MR\\\"]\\) returns an Association containing the unfolded \
\\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\"spectrum\\\", \\\"TI\\\"]\\) and smoothed density \
functions calculated via Kernel Density Estimation \
(KDE).\\n\\!\\(\\*StyleBox[RowBox[{\\\"Unfold\\\", \\\"[\\\", \
StyleBox[\\\"spectrum\\\", \\\"TI\\\"], \\\",\\\", StyleBox[\\\"opts\\\", \
\\\"TI\\\"], \\\"]\\\"}], \\\"MR\\\"]\\) allows specifying options for the \
kernel distribution.\\n\\!\\(\\)\\n\\!\\(\\)**Output Association Keys**\\n\\!\
\\(\\)* \\\"UnfoldedLevels\\\": List of unfolded eigenvalues (mean spacing = \
1).\\n\\!\\(\\)* \\\"SmoothCDF\\\": Pure function representing the cumulative \
mean level number N(E).\\n\\!\\(\\)* \\\"SmoothPDF\\\": Pure function \
representing the mean level density \[Rho](E).\\n\\!\\(\\)* \
\\\"Bandwidth\\\": The bandwidth parameter used in the KDE.\\n\\!\\(\\)* \
\\\"OriginalLevels\\\": The sorted input \
spectrum.\\n\\!\\(\\)\\n\\!\\(\\)**Options**\\n\\!\\(\\)* \\\"Bandwidth\\\": \
(Default: Automatic) Controls the smoothing scale. Set a Real number to \
manually tune the separation between secular variation and \
fluctuations.\\n\\!\\(\\)* \\\"Kernel\\\": (Default: \\\"Gaussian\\\") \
Specifies the kernel function type (e.g., \\\"Epanechnikov\\\", \
\\\"Rectangular\\\").\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
